---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { tok } from '../lib/tokens.mjs';
---

<Legal heading="Risk Disclosure" kicker="Disclosure">
  <p set:html={tok(
    'FGFC Markets Global Ltd (“the Company”) holds a [LICENSE TYPE], license number [LICENSE NUMBER], under supervision of [REGULATOR FULL NAME] in [JURISDICTION]. This document summarises the principal risks of trading Contracts for Difference (“CFDs”). It does not list every risk, and it does not replace independent advice.'
  )} />

  <h2>1. Leverage</h2>
  <p>
    CFDs are leveraged instruments. A small movement in the price of the underlying asset
    produces a proportionally larger movement in the value of your position — in your
    favour or against you. Price movements can erode a position quickly, and in some
    jurisdictions losses may exceed the funds deposited.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Suitability</h2>
  <p>
    CFDs will not suit every investor. Before opening an account, satisfy yourself that
    you understand how these instruments behave, weigh whether your financial
    circumstances can absorb this level of risk, and consult an independent adviser where
    needed. Commit only funds you can afford to lose in full.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Market risk</h2>
  <p>
    Prices of underlying assets respond to economic, political and issuer-specific events
    that cannot be predicted. Gaps, illiquidity and volatility can prevent orders —
    including stop orders — from executing at the requested level.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Past performance</h2>
  <p>
    Historical results carry no weight in predicting future outcomes, and no projection
    issued by the Company should be read as a guarantee.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Costs and charges</h2>
  <p>
    Spreads, commissions, overnight financing and other charges reduce the return on a
    position and increase the loss on an unprofitable one. Details of all applicable
    costs are disclosed before an account is opened.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Technology risk</h2>
  <p>
    Online trading depends on networks, devices and software. Outages, latency or
    failures — on your side or the Company’s — can delay or prevent order placement,
    modification or closure.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Compensation arrangements</h2>
  <p set:html={tok(
    'Eligible clients of FGFC Markets Global Ltd are covered under the [INVESTOR COMPENSATION / GUARANTEE FUND NAME], within the limits that scheme sets.'
  )} />

  <h2>8. Questions</h2>
  <p set:html={tok(
    'Questions about this disclosure can be addressed to compliance@[DOMAIN] or in writing to [FULL REGISTERED ADDRESS].'
  )} />

  <p class="note" set:html={tok('Last updated: [DATE].')} />
</Legal>
